flowchart TD
  ui[React Home UI] --> drop[Upload modal / drag drop]
  drop --> form[Build multipart payload]
  form --> api[POST /api/upload]
  api --> multer[Multer memory parser]
  multer --> parsed[Decoded multipart]
  parsed --> conflict{Exists and no force}
  conflict -->|yes| r400[400 File already exists]
  conflict -->|no| mkdir[Create missing directories]
  mkdir --> write[Write buffer to disk]
  write --> ok[200 success]
